# Corpus state is deliberately NOT ignored. The transition history and the verdict
# ledger are the audit trail — committing them is what makes an approval
# reconstructable months later.

# A snapshot of the previous implementation and its corpus, kept to read from while
# this one is rebuilt. Ignored because a second copy of the knowledge base is not the
# knowledge base, and the real record of what it said is the git history.
.corpus-archive/
